      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "仲間の猟師や村人の行方が判らないんだ。\nどこかに捕まってるのかもしれない……\nファウヌスの森にいる呪術師の集団が犯人だ。\n奴らと戦って気を引いてくれないか？",
        "official_en": "My fellow hunters entered Faun's Forest and haven't\nbeen seen since! I heard there's spellcasters who live\nthere. Word is that they kidnap people! Can you\nplease find them and rescue everyone?",
        "real_en": "My fellow hunters entered Faunus Forest and haven't\nbeen seen since! I heard there's spellcasters who live\nthere. Word is that they kidnap people! Can you\nplease find them and rescue everyone?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
