      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あんたらが奴らと戦ってくれている間に\n行方不明になった奴らを捜したんだが……\n一人も見つかりやしねえ。死体すらねえ。\n何が起きているんだか……スッキリしねえな。",
        "official_en": "While you were fighting the spellcasters, I searched\nfor those who have gone missing. I couldn't find\nanyone. Not even a body. What do you suppose it\nmeans? I'm so confused.",
